==Battleground==
*15 [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~21.33 seconds<sup>600f~640f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Funghi (Enemy)|Funghi]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 16~21.33 seconds<sup>480f~640f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

